<title>LATVIA: UNIBANKA, VALMIERA GAIN ON SLOW MARKET.</title>
<headline>UNIBANKA, VALMIERA GAIN ON SLOW MARKET.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unibanka and Valmiera Glassfibre</p>
<p>were among the few gainers on Monday while most official list</p>
<p>stocks lost ground.</p>
<p>Unibanka added five santimes to 3.36 lats and the Valmiera</p>
<p>Glassfibre rose two santimes to 1.52 lats. Other shares can be</p>
<p>bought (B) or sold (S) at the following prices and in the</p>
<p>following volume, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
